65	/** A caller-owned account session. Preparation consumes no count/history; successful text delivery advances it.
66	 *  When `upsellClose` is supplied, its frozen close is composed after each lesson (and any invitation),
67	 *  rotated so the same close text is never delivered verbatim back-to-back. */
